    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DEADLY PLATFORM</h2>There is only one rule, do not die. Beat up every challenge on your way to the glory.<br><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Seize the traps before you move.<br></li><li>You can't continue from the last run if you leave, beware!<br></li><li>Be cautious with traps, which can be unmeaningfully hard or annoying.<br></li><li>Every trap and parkour will lead you to death if you are not careful. Accommodate or die multiple times.<br></li><li>For every trap and parkour you beat, there comes joy and glory.<br></li><li>After passing checkpoint, you only have 3 chance. Use it wisely.<br></li><li>Don't forget, the faster you finish, the more chantful glory you get against your friends.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DEADLY PLATFORM</h2>There is only one rule, do not die. Beat up every challenge on your way to the glory.<br><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Seize the traps before you move.<br></li><li>You can't continue from the last run if you leave, beware!<br></li><li>Be cautious with traps, which can be unmeaningfully hard or annoying.<br></li><li>Every trap and parkour will lead you to death if you are not careful. Accommodate or die multiple times.<br></li><li>For every trap and parkour you beat, there comes joy and glory.<br></li><li>After passing checkpoint, you only have 3 chance. Use it wisely.<br></li><li>Don't forget, the faster you finish, the more chantful glory you get against your friends.</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Lots of challenges and meaningful journey that comes with beating parkours waits for you with 3D and Third-Person camera. Not every obstacle is easy, watch out!",
